:: Widgets Bailey HQ [widget]
<<widget "passoutbaileyhq">>
	<<if isPlayerNonparasitePregnancyEnding()>>
		<<pregnancyWatersBrokenPassout "baileyhq">>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[Everything fades to black...|Passout Bailey HQ]]>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "rumorsBaileyHq">>
	<<cleareventpool>>
	<<addinlineevent "undertaker" 1>>
		"Hey, have you heard about the undertakers?"
		<br>
		"Shut up."
		<br>
		"What? I'm just asking a question."
		<br>
		"Shut the fuck up if you don't wanna be next to be buried."
		<br>
		"Buried? The hell are you talking about?"
		<br>
		"Sometimes Bailey needs certain people to disappear, does that answer your question?"
		<br>
		"And they bury them? Here?"
		<br>
		"What do you think the shovels are for? Now shut up."
		<br><br>
	<</addinlineevent>>
	<<addinlineevent "smugglers" 1>>
		"Where the hell is Bailey getting all of these items anyway?"
		<br>
		"It's the smuggling ring man, Bailey's got them under <<nnpc_his "Bailey">> thumb."
		<br>
		"Damn, them too?"
		<br>
		"The entire underworld is <<nnpc_his "Bailey">> playground, its an open secret at this point."
		<br><br>
	<</addinlineevent>>
	<<addinlineevent "quinn" 1>>
		"How do you think Bailey gets away with all this?"
		<br>
		"How else? <<nnpc_Hes "Bailey">> got the mayor in <<nnpc_her "Bailey">> pocket."
		<br>
		"The mayor? Why? It's not like Quinn needs the cash."
		<br>
		"Not money dumbass, Bailey's got dirt on <<nnpc_him "Quinn">>, gotta be."
		<br>
		"Dirt bad enough to shut the mayor up? How did <<nnpc_he "Bailey">> get <<nnpc_his "Bailey">> on that?"
		<br>
		"Don't know, don't care, now shut up before <<nnpc_he "Bailey">> somehow gets word we talked about this."
		<br><br>
	<</addinlineevent>>
	<<addinlineevent "guns" 1>>
		"Have you seen the last shipment we got?"
		<br>
		"Fucking guns mate, I heard its military hardware, even the gun cases are military."
		<br>
		"Bailey's got his hands on the military?"
		<br>
		"Well probably not, but it certainly looks like <<nnpc_he "Bailey">> has the resources or the people to smuggle military gear."
		<br><br>
	<</addinlineevent>>
	<<addinlineevent "antiques" 1>>
		"Have you heard about the last operation?"
		<br>
		"Oh yeah, we got lots of valuables this time."
		<br>
		"Yeah, heard we got paintings and some antiques."
		<br>
		"Collectors would pay a pretty penny for those, just wish we got a cut."
		<br>
		"In your dreams..."
		<br><br>
	<</addinlineevent>>
	<<runeventpool>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "innerOutskirtsEvents">>
	<<effects>>

	<<if $baileyHQ.alertness gte 25>>
		<<set _badEventChance to 3>>
	<<elseif $baileyHQ.alertness gte 15>>
		<<set _badEventChance to 2>>
	<<else>>
		<<set _badEventChance to 1>>
	<</if>>

	<<cleareventpool>>
	<<addinlineevent "nothing" 1>>
		<<rumorsBaileyHq>>

		You make your way closer to the complex uneventfully.
		<br><br>
		
		<<link [[Next (0:05)|Bailey HQ Inner]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
	<</addinlineevent>>
	<<addinlineevent "guards smoke" _badEventChance>>
		<<generate1>><<generate2>><<person1>>
		You spot a couple of guards on their smoke break. They're in a spot with high visibility so sneaking past them isn't an option.
		<br><br>

		<<if $baileyHQ.alertness gte 25>>
			<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 1500>>
		<<elseif $baileyHQ.alertness gte 15>>
			<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 1000>>
		<<else>>
			<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 500>>
		<</if>>
		<<if Time.dayState is "night">>
			<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to $skulduggerydifficulty / 2>>
		<</if>>

		<<link [[Cause a distraction (0:02)|Bailey HQ Inner Outskirts Traverse Distract]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><<skulduggerydifficulty>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Wait for them to leave (1:00)|Bailey HQ Inner]]>><<pass 60>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<</addinlineevent>>
	<<addinlineevent "security camera" _badEventChance>>
		<<pass 10>>
		The area is completely covered by security cameras 
		<<if $baileyHQ.alertness gte 25>>
			and you can see the telltale sign that someone is watching <span class="red">all of them</span> through the red blinking lights.
			<br><br>
			<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 1500>>
		<<elseif $baileyHQ.alertness gte 15>>
			and you see that <span class="yellow">most</span> are being monitored.
			<br><br>
			<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 1000>>
		<<else>>
			but <span class="green"> less than half are being monitored.
			<br><br>
			<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 500>>
		<</if>>
		<<if Time.dayState is "night">>
			<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to $skulduggerydifficulty / 2>>
		<</if>>
		<<skulduggerycheck>>
		<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
			<<if $baileyHQ.alertness gte 25>>
				Regardless, you manage to find the few gaps and blindspots throughout the security network and <span class="green">slip past unnoticed</span>.
			<<elseif $baileyHQ.alertness gte 15>>
				You manage to spot all of the inactive cameras and weave your way around the gaps to <span class="green">slip in unnoticed</span>.
			<<else>>
				You relatively easily <span class="green">slip past</span> the security cameras with all of the gaps available to you.
			<</if>>
		<<else>>
			You try to slip past the security cameras but <span class="red">you make a mistake</span> and notice an active camera looking straight at you too late.
			<<set $baileyHQ.alertness += 15>><<alertnessclamp>>
		<</if>>
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Next|Bailey HQ Inner]]>><</link>>
	<</addinlineevent>>
	<<addinlineevent "guards patrol" _badEventChance>>
		<<generate1>><<generate2>><<person1>>
		You spot a couple of guards on their patrol, <span class="red">they're coming your way</span>.
		<br><br>

		<<if $baileyHQ.alertness gte 25>>
			<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 1500>>
		<<elseif $baileyHQ.alertness gte 15>>
			<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 1000>>
		<<else>>
			<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 500>>
		<</if>>
		<<if Time.dayState is "night">>
			<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to $skulduggerydifficulty / 2>>
		<</if>>

		<<link [[Hide (0:10)|Bailey HQ Inner Outskirts Traverse Hide]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><<skulduggerydifficulty>>
	<</addinlineevent>>
	<<runeventpool>>
<</widget>>
